
### 1. Create supplier address
POST http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "streetAddress": "Testikatu 10",
  "postalCode": "00100",
  "city": "Helsinki",
  "country": "Finland"
}

> {%
    client.log("Created address: " + JSON.stringify(response.body));
    client.global.set("addressId", response.body.id.toString());
%}


### 2. Get all supplier addresses
GET http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses
Accept: application/json


### 3. Get addresses for supplier 1
GET http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses?supplierId=1
Accept: application/json


### 4. Get newly created address by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses/{{addressId}}
Accept: application/json


### 5. Update newly created address
PUT http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses/{{addressId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supplierId": 1,
  "streetAddress": "Uusi katu 15",
  "postalCode": "00200",
  "city": "Espoo",
  "country": "Finland"
}


### 6. Verify updated address
GET http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses/{{addressId}}
Accept: application/json


### 7. Delete newly created address
DELETE http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses/{{addressId}}


### 8. Verify deletion (expected 404)
GET http://localhost:8081/supplieraddresses/{{addressId}}
Accept: application/json
